  "description": "Eight years into marriage, a devoted housewife leads what seems like a comfortable middle-class life while raising her two young sons. Hoping to give her eldest child an academic advantage, she enrolls him in a prestigious language academy run by a highly respected native-speaking instructor. But behind the institution’s spotless reputation lies a secret world of temptation. As her son attends class, she is lured into an exclusive private area where forbidden desires and scandalous group encounters unfold beyond closed doors.\n\n_Source: [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/foreign_language_teacher), translated_\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/foreign_language_teacher)",
